592
01:14:21,580 --> 01:14:30,800
She continues, on the contrary, when we're not attached, our relationships with others are harmonious. And in fact, we care more about them.

593
01:14:31,120 --> 01:14:35,320
We become more compassionate, more empathic toward others.

594
01:14:39,560 --> 01:14:48,880
Detachment or unconditional self-esteem simply means that we are distancing ourselves or not experiencing as much feelings of jealousy, feelings of envy,

595
01:14:49,340 --> 01:14:58,720
constant superiority or inferiority, ongoing comparison to others. It means on many levels that we are one with them.

